  "description": "Reid Impact | 26 inch kids' mountain bike\nThe Reid Impact 26\" is a versatile kids' mountain bike designed for young riders aged 10–13 who are ready to explore further. With a durable steel frame, 7-speed Shimano gears and reliable V brakes, it's built for everyday riding, local adventures and discovering new places on two wheels.\nThe 7-speed Shimano gear system gives young riders a range of gears to help tackle different routes and gradients, while the powerful V brakes provide responsive stopping and control when riding around the neighbourhood or exploring local parks.\nSleek steel tubing gives the Impact a durable, premium-looking finish, combining a sophisticated style with the practicality needed for everyday adventures. Its 26\" wheels make it a great choice for young riders ready for a larger bike and more freedom on their rides.\nFrom neighbourhood streets and family rides to local parks and outdoor trails, the Reid Impact is ready to help young cyclists build confidence, develop independence and enjoy every new adventure.\nWho is the Impact for?\nThe Impact 26\" Kids' Mountain Bike is ideal for:\n\nYoung riders aged 10–13\nRiders ready for a larger 26\" wheel bike\nChildren developing confidence on longer rides\nRiders looking for versatile 7-speed gearing\nYoung cyclists learning to ride on different routes and terrain\nKids who enjoy exploring neighbourhoods, parks and outdoor spaces\nParents looking for an affordable bike with a premium feel\nEveryday adventures, from family rides to outdoor exploration\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. The Reid Impact 26\" is designed for riders aged 10–13. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
